                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I joined @RepEspaillat in introducing the Protecting Sensitive Locations Act to stop ICE raids in schools, hospitals, and other essential places.\n\nNo one should fear ICE while seeking education or care.\n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting to protect immigrant communities from this intimidation.",
