                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "70M Americans receive Medicaid\u2013including 39% of children.\n\nIn #NY10, 221K Medicaid recipients would see their coverage eviscerated.\n\n41% of NY children receive insurance through Medicaid. This budget would slash their benefits, along with 60% of all seniors in NY nursing homes.",
