                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In #NY10, 12,000 people who purchase health insurance through an ACA marketplace would see their premiums rise by nearly $3k\u2014a 48% increase.\n\nAt a time of rising costs and an affordability crisis, the GOP is gutting every government program that makes health care affordable.",
