                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "Over 72 million children, families, and seniors depend on Medicaid for vital health care coverage. Over one in five Americans.\n \nThe GOP\u2019s Medicaid cuts are an attack on our most vulnerable.\n \nDemocrats stand uniformly opposed to their cruelty. https://t.co/pHGclGhYLL",
