                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 60,
                "retweet_count": 87,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On the 15th anniversary of the Affordable Care Act, the Trump administration is trying to cut Medicaid, raise health care costs, and eliminate coverage for millions.\n\nWith costs already out of control, we need legislation to build on the ACA\u2019s historic progress, not dismantle it.",
