                "retweet_count": 26,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In 1967, Congress guaranteed Medicaid recipients' right to pick their provider.   \n\nSouth Carolina is trying to deny patients' ability to choose Planned Parenthood for reproductive care.   \n\nI joined @ReproCaucus in an Amicus Brief urging SCOTUS to end the GOP's war on women.",
