                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was a pleasure joining @RyanHealthNYC on the Lower East Side for their annual Health & Resource Fair.\n\nFor 60 years, Community Health Centers have provided vital primary care rooted in trust, equity, and access.\n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting Republicans\u2019 attempts to slash coverage for these essential clinics and ensure every New Yorker gets the care they need.",
