                "reply_count": 59,
                "retweet_count": 30,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "August recess showed that voters around the country are outraged at their Republican reps for cancelling health care for +15M Americans, forcing hundreds of hospitals to close, and increasing health care costs for everyone \u2014 all to allow for massive tax cuts for billionaires.\n\nThe GOP can try to \u201crebrand\u201d the Big Ugly Law all they  want, but Americans aren\u2019t stupid.\n\nSmoke and mirrors won\u2019t work.",
